<title>USA: Kensey Nash says Angio-Seal back on market.</title>
<headline>Kensey Nash says Angio-Seal back on market.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Pa. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kensey Nash Corp said Tuesday that U.S. shipments of its Angio-Seal puncture closure device would be renewed immediately, ending a temporary suspension of production of the company's lead product.</p>
</text>
